{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"destructive","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DismissBehavior","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI15DismissBehaviorV","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissBehavior","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this behavior when you want to dismiss a window regardless of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any conditions that would normally prevent the dismissal. Dismissing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"windows in this matter may result in loss of state."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On macOS, this behavior will cause windows to dismiss even when they are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"currently showing a modal presentation, such as a sheet or alert."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Additionally, a document window will not show the save dialog when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"there are unsaved changes and the window is dismissed with this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"behavior."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On iOS, this behavior behaves the same as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"interactive"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissBehavior"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/DismissBehavior\/destructive","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"